#. どうした？　何か見つけたか？
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What is it? Did you find something?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
#. 死体の傍に、こんな物が落ちてたんだけど…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah... This was on the ground near the body."
msgstr ""

#. …見た事ない鍵だな。
#. 一体、どこの鍵だ…？
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I've never seen this key before. What could it\n"
"possibly go to...?"
msgstr ""

#. …十神クンでも、わからない？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So even you don't know, then?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木よ、お前に重要な任務を与えてやろう。
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Makoto...I'm going to give you a very important task."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. その鍵を使えば、今まで閉ざされていた場所にも
#. 入れるようになるのかもしれん…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That key might give you access to certain areas we\n"
"thought were locked."
msgstr ""

#. それを確かめろって…？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. ５階の<CLT 3>生物室<CLT>、４階の<CLT 3>学園長室<CLT>と<CLT 3>情報処理室<CLT>、
#. それと、<CLT 3>寄宿舎の２階<CLT>だったな…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>bio lab<CLT>, the <CLT 3>data center<CLT>, the <CLT 3>headmaster's\n"
"room<CLT>, and <CLT 3>the dorm rooms on the 2nd floor<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 任せたぞ…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It's in your hands."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>要は…パシリか……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I'm your errand boy now...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いったん整理しよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just to make things clear...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>昨日の夜…ボクは<CLT><CLT 3>覆面姿の謎の人物<CLT><CLT 4>に襲われた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Last night, I was attacked by <CLT><CLT 3>someone wearing a\n"
"mask<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、その謎の人物は今…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And whoever that was—now they're...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なぜだかわからないけど、
#. ボクの目の前で死体となっている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't know why, but now they're laying dead in front\n"
"of me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
#. だから言ったじゃーん！　死体が落ちてるって！
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Kyeeehahaha! I told ya, there's a corpse hangin' out\n"
"here!"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これって…死体なの…？
#. ホントに…死んでるの…？
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Are they really...dead? Is this really a dead body...?"
msgstr ""

#. すぐに調べるぞ。
#. ただし…
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You need to begin looking around right away.\n"
"However..."
msgstr ""

#. …慎重に慎重を重ねろ。
#. 何があるかわからんぞ。
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Be ever so careful. There's no telling what you might\n"
"find."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. こいつは何者だ…？
#. なぜ、ここで死んでいる…？
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Who is this? How did they wind up dead here...?"
msgstr ""

#. それを確認しない事には…
#. 話が進まんな。
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "We can't move forward until we figure that out."
msgstr ""

#. 何か嫌な予感はしていたが…
#. まさか爆発するとはな…
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I had a bad feeling about that body. But I never\n"
"imagined it would explode..."
msgstr ""

#. だが、あれが誰なのか…
#. こいつは面白くなってきたな…
msgctxt "0024 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Regardless, I can't help but wonder who it was. Things\n"
"are growing more interesting by the minute..."
msgstr ""

#. 落とし物は…
msgctxt "0025 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Just throw it in the lost and found!"
msgstr ""

#. 死体でもちゃんと届け出ろってね！
#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Even a dead body can find its way home that way!\n"
"Kyeeehahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. し、視界の端に…ちらりと何か見えた気が…
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I saw something out of the c-corner of my eye, just\n"
"for a s-second..."
msgstr ""

#. もしかして…死体じゃないわよね…？
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "It's a c-corpse...isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうみたいなんだ…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, I guess so..."
msgstr ""

#. みたいって…どっちよ！？
#. 死体なの…？　そうじゃないの…？
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You g-guess? Which is it!? Is it a d-dead body or\n"
"not...!?"
msgstr ""

#. …死体だよ。
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's a dead body."
msgstr ""

#. 嫌…嫌よ…見ないわよ…
#. ま、また気を失ったら困るし…
msgctxt "0032 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"H-Hate this... I hate it! I'm not gonna l-look at it.\n"
"I don't wanna faint a-again..."
msgstr ""

#. ボク達も困るから…
#. 見ない方がいいと思うよ…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, we don't want that either. So I think it's best\n"
"if you don't look."
msgstr ""

#. うぅ…うううぅ…みんな死んでばっかじゃない…
#. な、なんで…こんな事になってるのよ…
msgctxt "0034 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Gh...nn... Everyone is d-dying... Why? Why is this\n"
"h-happening?"
msgstr ""

#. ど…どうなってるの…？
#. あれって…誰なの…？
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What's going on...? Who is that?"
msgstr ""

#. さすが殺人鬼…
#. あの爆発でも無傷とは…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Even the explosion was done perfectly, though. I gotta\n"
"hand it to whoever did it..."
msgstr ""

#. …って、感心していいのかな？
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Is it wrong to admire that kind of skill?"
msgstr ""

#. なんで、ここで死体なんだべ…？
#. ていうか、これ誰だべ？
msgctxt "0038 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What's this body doing here? I mean...who *is* it!?"
msgstr ""

#. むむむ…黒幕が黒コゲ…
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hrmm... The mastermind just got masterlandmine'd..."
msgstr ""

#. 自分で言っておいて、なかなかのデキだべ！
#. 心のネタ帳にメモっとかねば！
msgctxt "0040 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Pretty good, right? That one's goin' in the jokebook\n"
"of my soul!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも、まずは…
#. あの死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to check the body before anything else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも、まずは…
#. あの死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to check the body before anything else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも、まずは…
#. あの死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to check the body before anything else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも、まずは…
#. あの死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to check the body before anything else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも、まずは…
#. あの死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to check the body before anything else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まずは…この死体が誰なのかを
#. 確かめないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We need to find out who this actually is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、被害者の顔は覆面で覆われてて…
#. これじゃあ、誰なのか判別出来ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But there's no way to tell with the mask covering\n"
"their face like that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、体を覆った<CLT><CLT 3>“白衣”<CLT><CLT 4>のせいで、
#. 体型や服装の特徴さえわからない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the <CLT><CLT 3>white coat<CLT><CLT 4> they're wearing makes it\n"
"impossible to tell anything about the body itself.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>謎の被害者…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The victim is a total mystery...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…１つだけ確かなのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But one thing I *do* know...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>昨日の夜、ボクはこの覆面の人物に襲われている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...is that whoever this is, they attacked me last\n"
"night in my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、その人がどうして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But why...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな所で…死んでるんだよ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How did they wind up dead in here!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 呼吸はない…胸も動いていない…
#. 一切の生命的活動が停止しているようだ…
msgctxt "0054 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Their heart isn't beating, they're not breathing,\n"
"all signs of life have come to a complete stop..."
msgstr ""

#. 腹部に突き刺さった<CLT 3>ナイフ<CLT>のせいで、
#. 服が真っ赤な血で染まっている…
msgctxt "0055 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Thanks to the <CLT 3>knife<CLT> that's been driven into their\n"
"stomach, their clothes are stained a bright red."
msgstr ""

#. 血は止まっているようだが、
#. まだ濡れたまま、<CLT 3>乾いていない<CLT>ようだな。
msgctxt "0056 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It appears the bleeding has stopped, but the blood\n"
"that's there is <CLT 3>still wet<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 触ると、汚れる危険性があるぞ…
msgctxt "0057 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Be careful you don't touch it and get some on you..."
msgstr ""

#. 冷静に分析してる場合じゃねーって…
msgctxt "0058 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "How can you be so calm at a time like this?"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、誰なんだって。
#. 顔も体も隠れてるし、さっぱりだべ…
msgctxt "0059 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Who *is* it!? Their face and body are all hidden,\n"
"so I don't have a clue..."
msgstr ""

#. 多分…<CLT 3>女の子<CLT>だよ。
msgctxt "0060 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm pretty sure it's a <CLT 3>girl<CLT> at least..."
msgstr ""

#. へ…？　なんで？
msgctxt "0061 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? How can you tell?"
msgstr ""

#. 胸の膨らみとか…全体的な体のラインもそうだし…
msgctxt "0062 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Well...I think I see the outline of her chest. And\n"
"just the general shape of the body..."
msgstr ""

#. 間違いないよ…
#. その人、女の子だよ…
msgctxt "0063 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, the more I look, the more I'm sure it's a girl."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…女の子？
#. じゃあ、ひょっとして…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Really? Then it could be—!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！　つーかさぁ！
msgctxt "0065 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahaha! Okay then!"
msgstr ""

#. その覆面を剥がしちゃえばいいじゃーん！！
msgctxt "0066 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Let's just tear the mask clean off!"
msgstr ""

#. おい、待て…
msgctxt "0067 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Wait, don't—!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…だけど遅かった。
#. 十神クンが呼び止めた時には、もう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But by the time he called out, it was already too\n"
"late.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんの手は覆面を掴んでいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko's hand shot out toward the mask.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、次の瞬間…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And in the next instant...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目がくらむような光と…
#. 耳をつんざくような轟音…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there was a blinding light, and a deafening roar.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>爆発した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The body...blew up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>爆発した爆発した爆発した爆発した爆発した爆発した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It blew up it blew up it blew up it blew up it blew up\n"
"it blew up it blew up it blew up!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…視界が真っ暗になった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My vision started to darken. I prepared to pass out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Thế nhưng...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. …急げ、さっさと火を消すんだ。
msgctxt "0076 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hurry up, put out the fire."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その声が、飛びかけていたボクの意識を
#. 引きずり戻してくれた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As my consciousness attempted to float away, that\n"
"voice reached up and pulled it back down to Earth.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクの手に何かが渡された…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Someone pressed something into my hands.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…水の入ったバケツ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was...a bucket of water.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 早くしろ。水をかけるんだ。
msgctxt "0080 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Come on, dump the water on it."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…ッ！！
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、燃えさかる“死体の上半身”に目掛けて、
#. バケツの水を思いっきりぶちまけた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The upper half of the body was on fire. I took aim and\n"
"tossed the water as hard as I could.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「バッシャーン！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*SPLOOSH*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、すぐに火は勢いを失い…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Thankfully, that was enough to put out the fire.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あたりに不快な匂いだけを残して、
#. 完全に鎮火した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It died down, leaving behind only the unpleasant smell\n"
"of burning...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんとか…
#. 鎮火した…みたいだけど…
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I guess that took care of it..."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どういう事だべ…
#. いきなり……
msgctxt "0087 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But what the hell, man?"
msgstr ""

#. 爆発…したよね…？
msgctxt "0088 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It...exploded?"
msgstr ""

#. 何か…嫌な予感はしていたが…
#. まさか爆発するとは…
msgctxt "0089 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I...had a bad feeling about that body. But I never\n"
"imagined it would explode..."
msgstr ""

#. おかげで、死体が……
msgctxt "0090 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And now the body..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>真っ黒焦げ<CLT>だべ…！
#. スーパーウェルダンだべ…！
msgctxt "0091 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's <CLT 3>burnt to a crisp<CLT>! That's beyond well done, man!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと、ステーキに例えないでよ…！
#. 食べられなくなるじゃん…！
msgctxt "0092 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Don't compare it to a steak! I'll never be able to eat\n"
"steak again..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、これじゃあ…
#. もう本当にわからないね…
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But now that the body's charred, I really have no\n"
"idea..."
msgstr ""

#. この死体が…誰なのか…
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "How are we gonna find out who it was...?"
msgstr ""

#. …ここにいない人間は誰だ？
msgctxt "0095 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Who isn't here right now?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. ここにいない人間を考えれば、
#. 可能性は、自ずと絞られてくるはずだ…
msgctxt "0097 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If we consider who's not here, that will quickly\n"
"narrow down who it must be."
msgstr ""

#. ここにいない人間って…
msgctxt "0098 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "There's only one person missing..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切っち…だけだべ…
msgctxt "0099 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's...Kyoko."
msgstr ""

#. …き、霧切さんッ！？
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko!?"
msgstr "K-Kyoko?"

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、あの死体って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then that dead body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...is Kyoko?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違う…そんなはず…ッ！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No! That can't be right!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …落ち着け。
#. 俺は霧切だとは一言も言ってないぞ。
msgctxt "0104 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Calm down. I didn't say it was Kyoko."
msgstr ""

#. けどよ、他に誰が…
msgctxt "0105 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But, I mean...who else...?"
msgstr ""

#. まだいるじゃないか…
msgctxt "0106 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There *is* one other person."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕だよ…！
msgctxt "0107 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "The mastermind..."
msgstr ""

#. …えッ！？
msgctxt "0108 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cái gì!?"

#. く、黒幕って…！
msgctxt "0109 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Th-The mastermind!?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなん、あり得ねーって！！
#. 黒幕が黒コゲなんて悪い冗談だべ！！
msgctxt "0110 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Come on, there's no way! The MASTERMIND got\n"
"char-broiled!? Get serious!"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、普通であれば、
#. 考えられない可能性かもしれん。
msgctxt "0111 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I agree, normally the idea wouldn't be worth\n"
"considering."
msgstr ""

#. だが、俺達には思い当たる節があるはずだぞ。
msgctxt "0112 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But I have reason to believe it may be true."
msgstr ""

#. もし、黒幕が死んだのなら、
#. あの件にも説明が付けられるはずだ…
msgctxt "0113 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind being dead would explain that other\n"
"matter, wouldn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマが急に動かなくなった件だ…
msgctxt "0114 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma can hardly move around if its master is dead,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だけどよ！　あの死体は女なんだろ？
#. だとすると、おかしくねーか？
msgctxt "0115 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"B-But...that corpse is a girl, right? It doesn't make\n"
"any sense!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、アルターエゴが言ってたべ？
msgctxt "0116 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I mean, remember what Alter Ego said?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、すべてを仕組んだ黒幕は、
#. その学園長って可能性が高いんだ。
msgctxt "0117 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"So that same person may very well be the mastermind\n"
"who planned all this out."
msgstr ""
"Vì vậy, rất có thể chính người đó là kẻ chủ mưu đã vạch ra\n"
"tất cả những chuyện này."

#. ちなみに、その学園長は<CLT 3>３０代後半の男性<CLT>で…
msgctxt "0118 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"And according to the files, the headmaster is <CLT 3>a man\n"
"in his late thirties<CLT>."
msgstr ""
"Bên cạnh đó, theo như các tập tin thì hiệu trưởng là <CLT 3>một\n"
"người đàn ông U40<CLT>..."

#. 今も…<CLT 3>この学園内にいる<CLT>可能性が高いみたいだよ…
msgctxt "0119 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"It seems possible, even likely, that he's <CLT 3>somewhere\n"
"in this school<CLT> right now."
msgstr ""
"Có khả năng rất cao là hiện tại ông ta vẫn đang <CLT 3>ở đâu đó\n"
"trong ngôi trường này<CLT>..."

#. <CLT 3>３０代後半の男性<CLT>って…
#. 明らかに死体の特徴とは一致しねーぞ？
msgctxt "0120 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"He said the mastermind is some <CLT 3>middle-aged dude<CLT>,\n"
"right? Which the corpse obviously isn't!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら…
#. 黒幕は…学園長じゃなくて…
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then could that mean...the mastermind *isn't* the\n"
"headmaster...?"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんが言ってた…例の女子高校生…
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it the teenage girl Kyoko told me about?"
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の絶望……
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The Ultimate Despair...?"
msgstr ""

#. は…？
msgctxt "0124 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. 戦刃むくろ…１６人目の高校生…
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Mukuro Ikusaba...the sixteenth student at Hope's\n"
"Peak..."
msgstr ""

#. …なんの話だ？
msgctxt "0126 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. この間、霧切さんから、
#. こっそり教えてもらったんだよ…
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The other day, Kyoko confided in me..."
msgstr ""

#. この学園には…１６人目の高校生がいるって…
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She said there was a sixteenth student here in the\n"
"school."
msgstr ""

#. 詳しく話せ…
msgctxt "0129 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I think you'd better tell us everything you know."
msgstr ""

#. え、えっと…霧切さんが言ってたのは…
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well, all Kyoko told me was..."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろ…
msgctxt "0131 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Mukuro Ikusaba..."
msgstr ""

#. この学園に潜む１６人目の高校生…
msgctxt "0132 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The sixteenth student, lying hidden somewhere in this\n"
"school..."
msgstr ""

#. “超高校級の絶望”と呼ばれる女子高校生…
msgctxt "0133 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The one they call the Ultimate Despair..."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろに気を付けて。
msgctxt "0134 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Watch out for her."
msgstr "Hãy cẩn thận cô ta."

#. 霧切さんは、その<CLT 3>戦刃むくろ<CLT>ってヤツこそが、
#. 黒幕だと睨んでいるみたいだった…
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It sounded like Kyoko thinks <CLT 3>Mukuro Ikusaba<CLT> is the\n"
"mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. いいえ…学園長は黒幕じゃないわ。
msgctxt "0136 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No...the headmaster isn't the mastermind, I'm sure of\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cái gì...?"

#. まだ確信は持てないけど、
#. それは間違いない…
msgctxt "0138 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I don't have proof yet, but I have no doubt I'm right."
msgstr ""

#. １６人目の高校生…女子高校生か…
#. 確かに、死体の特徴とは一致するな。
msgctxt "0139 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There's another student here, and it's a female? That\n"
"*would* match the body's characteristics..."
msgstr ""

#. しかも<CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>ってフレーズも、
#. 黒幕ちっくじゃない…？
msgctxt "0140 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And that phrase, <CLT 3>the Ultimate Despair<CLT>—it sounds\n"
"super mastermind-y, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. …つまり、黒幕は戦刃むくろって１６人目の高校生で、
#. そいつは、超高校級の絶望と呼ばれるヤツだったと？
msgctxt "0141 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Okay, so...the mastermind is this girl Mukuro? And\n"
"she's a student here? And she's the Ultimate Despair?"
msgstr ""

#. だけどよ、ツチノコみてーにずっと隠れてたそいつが、
#. どーして…
msgctxt "0142 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But if she's been hiding here in the school like some\n"
"teenage Bigfoot..."
msgstr ""

#. あそこで黒コゲになってんだって！？
msgctxt "0143 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...how'd she wind up burnt to a crisp!?"
msgstr ""

#. いくらなんでも意味不明だべ！
#. いきなり現れて、いきなり死んでるなんてよ！
msgctxt "0144 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"None of this makes any sense! To just suddenly show up\n"
"and then die!?"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、もう１度、
#. あの死体を調べてみる必要がありそうだな…
msgctxt "0145 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I think we'd better take a closer look at the body."
msgstr ""

#. 何か、身元を割り出す手掛かりが
#. 残っているかもしれん…
msgctxt "0146 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There may be some clues to help us figure out exactly\n"
"who it is."
msgstr ""

#. あ！　ちょっと待って！
msgctxt "0147 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ah! Hey, wait!"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだ？
msgctxt "0148 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr "...Cái gì?"

#. わ、忘れてない…？
#. 腐川の事……
msgctxt "0149 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "A-Aren't we forgetting something? You know...Toko?"
msgstr ""

#. あいつッ！　確か、ふっ飛ばされてたべ！
msgctxt "0150 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh yeah! She got totally blown up, huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. …忘れよう。
#. きっと、爆破されて粉微塵だ。
msgctxt "0151 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Forget about her. I'm sure the explosion vaporized\n"
"her."
msgstr ""

#. う…うぅ…ッ！
msgctxt "0152 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Nn...gh...!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、無事だった！
msgctxt "0153 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh! She survived!"
msgstr ""

#. なんだ…生きてたのか…
msgctxt "0154 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Oh...she survived..."
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？　今…何が…？
#. お、教えてください…白夜様…？
msgctxt "0155 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? What just h-happened...? Master...?"
msgstr ""

#. 金輪際、酸素は吸わないと
#. お前が高らかに宣言したところだ…
msgctxt "0156 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You declared for the whole world to hear that you\n"
"would never again inhale a single molecule of oxygen."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…白夜様が吐いたニ酸化炭素だけでいいです…
#. そ、それだけで…生きていけますから…
msgctxt "0157 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Oh. Then...I don't mind b-breathing in the carbon\n"
"dioxide you exhale. That's enough for m-me to live..."
msgstr ""

#. 不思議なキャッチボールだべ…
msgctxt "0158 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "This is the strangest back-and-forth I've ever seen..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう１度、死体を詳しく調べてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should take a close look at the body one more\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木、気を付けてね。
#. 相手は女の子なんだからね…
msgctxt "0160 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Watch yourself, Makoto. She may be dead, but she's\n"
"still a girl..."
msgstr ""

#. だ、大丈夫だよ。
#. ボクだって…そんなに死体を触れる訳じゃないし…
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"D-Don't worry. I don't plan on touching the body all\n"
"that much."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それこそ、霧切さんじゃないんだから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not Kyoko, after all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも…
#. あの死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0163 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I have to focus on the body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも…
#. あの死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0164 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I have to focus on the body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも、死体を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0165 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I have to focus on the body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
